Contractor Extension: Decision Options

From: Controller · To: CFO · Decision requested by September 26, 2026


CONTEXT
September spend was USD 218,000 against a USD 200,000 budget. The USD 18,000 (9%) variance is explained by a USD 12,000 contractor extension and USD 6,000 of travel.

OPTIONS EVALUATED
Option | Description | Estimate (fictional)
D1 | Maintain contractor support for one more month | Incremental cost about USD 8,000
D2 | Reduce contractor support now | About a two-week delay

RECOMMENDATION
The controller recommends D1. Neither option has been approved. CFO decision requested by September 26.

UNKNOWNS
D4. The revenue effect of either option is unknown. The operations lead has not yet confirmed the remaining contractor end date (due September 25).

Northstar Services is a fictional company. All names, figures, and dates are training material.
